    "text": "The friction coefficient between the board and the floor shown in diagram is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>μ</mi></math>. Find the maximum force that the man can exert on the rope, so that the board does not slip on the floor.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/14128_CA.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 112px;\" />\r",
